WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.563
- It's a special tribute to
our men and women in uniform.

00:00:02.563 --> 00:00:05.607
Happy Veterans' Day to you
all, here and out there.

00:00:05.607 --> 00:00:07.796
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.796 --> 00:00:10.240
We all have someone in our families

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.580
or close to us who's served.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:12.413
Do you have someone?

00:00:12.413 --> 00:00:14.253
- Yeah, I do.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.220
I've got three sisters,

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:21.470
and two of them married Air Force pilots.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:24.280
And then I have a nephew
that's an Air Force pilot,

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:28.960
and he's flown dozens of missions overseas

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.530
in Iraq, Iran.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.250
And these pilots name their airplanes,

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:35.955
and his plane is named Dr. Phil.

00:00:35.955 --> 00:00:37.745
- (laughs) Oh my God!

00:00:37.745 --> 00:00:39.380
It's painted on the side of his airplane

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.810
and it says "Dr. Phil" there.

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:42.320
I said, "Well, why did
you name it Dr. Phil?"

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:43.973
He said, "Well, I'm delivering the truth."

00:00:43.973 --> 00:00:46.400
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.050
- [Kelly] Oh my God, I love
that! His sense of humor.

